        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 54012SN, Siena Key in Lever with Round # 11 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Siena Key in Lever with Round Rose is available in a keyed entry or dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while the dummy lever function is just for looks and does not latch or lock. Choose from flat black or medium bronze finishes. The Siena Key in Lever with Round # 11 Rosette will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The Tuscany Siena Lever with #11 Rose is made from lost wax cast bronze and thus has an old world feel that makes it a great choice for historic homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Tuscany Siena Lever with #11 Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
